            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$P = 4x + 2 + \\dfrac{\\pi x}{2}$",
              "worked": "The quadrant has radius $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\nP &= (x+1)+x+(2x+1)+\\frac14(2\\pi x)\\\\\nP &= 4x+2+\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\n\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 28
          },
          {
            "id": "p32-q5-a-area",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "",
            "prompt": "$A =$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$A = x^2 + x + \\dfrac{\\pi x^2}{4}$",
              "worked": "Add the rectangle and quadrant areas.\n$$\\begin{align*}\nA &= x(x+1)+\\frac14\\pi x^2\\\\\nA &= x^2+x+\\frac{\\pi x^2}{4}\n\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 30
          }
