              "worked": "The remaining lower edge is $2x-3$, so the full rectangle width is $(2x-3)+x=3x-3$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\nP &= (3x-3)+x+(2x-3)+\\frac14(2\\pi x)\\\\\nP &= 6x-6+\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\n\\end{align*}$$",
