              "worked": "Subtract the quadrant from the rectangle of width $3x-3$ and height $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\nA &= x(3x-3)-\\frac14\\pi x^2\\\\\nA &= 3x^2-3x-\\frac{\\pi x^2}{4}\n\\end{align*}$$",
