              "mathematics": "The added instruction explicitly defines x as the dashed square's side. Each semicircle has diameter x and radius x/2, giving perimeter 2πx and area x² + πx²/2. The original source label has no dimension line, and its printed answers inconsistently use x as a square side and a semicircle radius.",
