            "answer": {
              "short": "$P = 2\\pi x$. Add four semicircular arcs of radius $\\frac{x}{2}$.",
              "worked": "Each semicircle has diameter $x$, so its radius is $\\frac{x}{2}$. The outer boundary consists of four semicircular arcs.\n$$\\begin{align*}\nP &= 4\\left(\\frac12\\times 2\\pi\\times\\frac{x}{2}\\right)\\\\\nP &= 2\\pi x\n\\end{align*}$$",
